    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The experiments show that the \u03c42-Bench benchmark is more challenging than traditional single-control benchmarks, with agents experiencing a significant drop in performance when shifting from a no-user to a dual-control setup. The results also highlight the importance of <strong>communication and coordination</strong> between the agent and user in achieving success.",
